WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.156
Hello, friends!

c2
00:00:02.156 --> 00:00:03.450
I am Nour.

c3
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.253
I have

c4
00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:05.233
one big,

c5
00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:07.000
yummy leaf.

c6
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.210
I eat it

c7
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.603
all alone.

c8
00:00:09.603 --> 00:00:11.450
Not much fun.

c9
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.358
I eat it

c10
00:00:12.358 --> 00:00:13.730
all again.

c11
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.675
Still not fun.

c12
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.861
Look! Here comes

c13
00:00:17.861 --> 00:00:19.575
my friend Pip.

c14
00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:21.193
Let us share!

c15
00:00:21.193 --> 00:00:21.754
Now we

c16
00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.300
both smile.

c17
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.744
Sharing makes

c18
00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:26.550
friends happy.

c19
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.625
Slow and steady,

c20
00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:30.550
side by side!
